(\\alpha = a/R\\).\n\nInsert (4) into (3):\n\n\\[\n(T_2 - T_1)R = I\\frac{a}{R}\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;(T_2 - T_1)=\\frac{I}{R^{2}}\\,a\n\\]\n\nUsing (1) and (2) to eliminate the tensions:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_1 &= m_A a + F + f_k = 20a + 84.05 \\\\[2mm]\nT_2 &= m_B g - m_B a = 98.10 - 10a\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n\nInsert these expressions into the torque relation:\n\n\\[\n\\bigl(98.10 - 10a\\bigr)-\\bigl(20a + 84.05\\bigr)=\\frac{I}{R^{2}}\\,a\n\\]\n\n\\[\n14.05 - 30a = \\frac{0.12}{0.20^{2}}\\,a = 3.0\\,a\n\\]\n\n\\[\n14.05 = 33.0\\,a \\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\boxed{a = 0.426\\ \\text{m·s}^{-2}}\n\\]\n\n(The sign is positive in the chosen left/down directions, confirming that **A moves toward the pulley and B moves downward**.)\n\n---\n\n### 5.  Tensions  \n\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_1 &= 20a + 84.05 = 20(0.4258'}], 'model': 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 'n': 1, 'reasoning_effort': None, 'reasoning_format': None, 'response_format': {'type': 'json_object'}, 'service_tier': 'on_demand', 'stop': None, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7}}
